{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"60cd2dedd2e0cef3e2bfac5a4ba29071bb52d2afbe9f7d9de1909642f6c675f4","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"3aec4007097be45ca60755881406d9f94a8d24e90f35899587c6153ec3b31009","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3b3a38f90dd7aa4ebbc5bcf4054b89ffcbeed424f89c5a388e6fc1ed30c4184c","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-cults/data/talents/demented/void.lua:279 says the monolith 'will attempt to daze enemies ... using your spellpower'. The translation drops 'attempt' and renders it as 每半回合对…敌人施加眩晕2回合, which reads as a guaranteed daze. That makes an attempt that saves or immunity can resist sound certain. Restore the qualifier, e.g. 尝试以你的法术强度眩晕…. The source location is unpinned and the envelope gives no checkout location, so the implementation was not checked."},{"revision_key":"3bdd721e24e93d4d4b7ec459bc9d648a57b7b25b2652c3011abb4ef5d9bd1d44","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"calamity.lua:72 says the effect 'will fade entirely if you break line of sight with your target for more than 2 turns', which means the target stays out of sight for more than 2 consecutive turns. The translation 如果在过去 2 回合里目标消失在你的视线中 means it fades if sight was lost at any moment in the past 2 turns. That changes both the condition and the threshold. Suggested: 若目标脱离你的视线超过 2 回合，所有诅咒都会消退。"},{"revision_key":"3c623f8392d37664f89e731f2c45ffbdc232582fd6ca3951e3c5c1413f1169f3","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3cfa2ffbf95cae29067e1e5112fc006e23943cb92a5a50e2f66b6eda6f32998a","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"intro-krog.lua:22-29 separates every paragraph with a blank line. In the translation only the first paragraph keeps its blank line; the next three paragraphs are joined by single line breaks, so the paragraph layout no longer matches. Also, 'as a result of the changes made to their bodies by the Ziguranth' became 作为上面条件的附加作用, which loses that the anti-magic comes from the Ziguranth's changes to the Krog body. Suggested: 由于伊格兰斯对其身体的改造，所有克罗格都被灌注了反魔法力量."},{"revision_key":"3de06b73a0b51dbd28b38d04af799009669159c5cb8e7557d9e4aadd0dd5fba9","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3ecc90f60d7381bbb8e1528445be11d2ebbe3196bcce4bb2a411218659f3a535","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4003c28c70f884c41ea92562aa07bd29d54b1a622c1d20bcc03fbdea9e920ca3","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"unlock-wyrmic_scourge.lua:21 'even they can be corrupted beyond hope' means even drakes can be corrupted past any hope of recovery. The translation 就连他们也能够被绝望所腐化 turns it into corrupted by despair. Suggested: 就连他们也可能被腐化到无可救药. Separately, source lines 22-24 have a blank line between 'vanquished it.' and 'You can now…'; the translation drops it and joins the two with a single line break."},{"revision_key":"4469daf6ff47e15bb6600a53ddf436ca4b27195aa40bbfe1d71f54c68e30bb54","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"4555f7111c53b6c0e80083bb8955fa94c4437290485284925c30ebb6f27b53aa","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"fay-willows.lua:491-507, three problems. (1) 'made we wonder as to just how long I was out' means how long the narrator was unconscious; the translation 他们在外面呆了多久 says how long they stayed outside. (2) 'brushed away some cobwebs from a nearby chair and table to eat my fill' became 擦去一些蜘蛛网，吃掉了它们, where 它们 reads as the cobwebs being eaten. Suggested: 然后坐下饱餐一顿. (3) The same 'the commander' switches between 指挥官 and 司令官 throughout the passage; the name should be consistent within the text."}]}